# MATLAB: MATLAB documentation (R2024a), "Language Fundamentals", keywords from iskeyword; requirements/languages/matlab.md
name     matlab octave

keyword  break case catch classdef continue else elseif end for function global if otherwise parfor
keyword  persistent return spmd switch try while methods properties events enumeration
builtin  true false pi disp fprintf sprintf zeros ones eye size length numel isempty error warning
builtin  plot figure hold

line-comment   %
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/^\&|~<>=:.
calls
hook     matlab
